          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku indi Hiyeli wakuBeteli watuŋili Yeriku. Hatuŋiliyi chikuku chakutuŋila mpwembu wafwishili mwanindi wawedi Abirami, hapatiliyi yenzelu yakumpwembu wafwishili mwanindi wakabinda Serubi; mwomwizu daYehova dahosheliyi kukanwa kamwana kaNuni Yoshuwa.",
          "type": "text",
